            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ahoffort"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used my home made sauerkraut and I added bacon. Plus cooked everything in the bacon pan. Great. I doubled this recipe and only had a little too much for the \"Grandmas polish perogies\" recipe on this site. I would have ran out had I not doubled this.",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-12T07:36:59.297Z"
