            },
            "reviewBody": "Hi Jill, Polish woman here to comment on your pierogi filling. Just Yummy! The sauerkraut filling my mother made was my favorite, so I was glad I found your recipe. I knew I found the recipe I needed when I saw that there were mushrooms in it! I also love mushrooms, so there it is... Btw Jill, there's no “E” at the end of the word Pierogi. Pierogi is already the plural form of the word. Keep your special recipes coming!",
